        networks, expensive on-chain operations, and complex bridging solutions.
        Moving data and value is slow, costly, and often insecure. Developers
        are forced to build on monolithic layers, while decision-makers worry
        about vendor lock-in and regulatory compliance.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
        What if you could securely connect it all instead?
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-gray-200" />

    <section id="features" class="py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">
          Orchestrate Anything, Anywhere. Securely.
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">
          nXCC provides the essential components to bind disparate systems into
          a single, cohesive application.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <li class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Define Logic, Not Infrastructure
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">
            Define complex, event-driven workflows in JavaScript. React to
            on-chain events, trigger APIs, and route assets across chains in a
            single, streamlined environment.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Compute with Confidence
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">
            Our Platform Services Enclave, powered by Trusted Execution
            Environments (TEEs), provides a verifiable black box for sensitive
            computations and policy enforcement.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Decentralize Trust, Not Just Assets
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">
            Move beyond centralized operators with a federated trust model. Run
            your own nodes or form a consortium, with on-chain identity
