          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">
            <strong>Solution:</strong>
            nXCC orchestrates the flow, computing on sensitive data inside TEEs,
            bridging rewards, and synchronizing state while preserving user privacy.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Automated Public Goods Funding
