              <span class="ml-3 text-gray-600">
                <strong>Open Source:</strong>
                Fork it, extend it, run it yourself. The core is built in Rust for
                performance and security.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0 text-brand">✓</span>
